      "title": "WorkFlows Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LoRA Loading — Native Loaders / LoRA 加载\n\n使用 **ComfyUI 原生 LoRA 加载器**，无需安装额外的自定义节点。\n\n加载多个 LoRA 时，请依次串联加载节点，并分别设置权重。不使用 LoRA 时，可将模型加载区域的输出直接连接到后续节点。\n\nUse **ComfyUI’s built-in LoRA loaders**. No additional custom nodes are required.\n\nTo apply multiple LoRAs, chain the loader nodes and set the strength of each LoRA individually. If no LoRA is needed, connect the model-loading outputs directly to the downstream nodes."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## LoRA Loading — Native Loaders / LoRA 加载\n\n使用 **ComfyUI 原生 LoRA 加载器**，无需安装额外的自定义节点。\n\n加载多个 LoRA 时，请依次串联加载节点，并分别设置权重。不使用 LoRA 时，可将模型加载区域的输出直接连接到后续节点。\n\nUse **ComfyUI’s built-in LoRA loaders**. No additional custom nodes are required.\n\nTo apply multiple LoRAs, chain the loader nodes and set the strength of each LoRA individually. If no LoRA is needed, connect the model-loading outputs directly to the downstream nodes."
      },
