      "widgets_values": [
        "## LoRA Loading — Power LoRA Loader / LoRA 加载\n\n使用 **Power LoRA Loader** 在同一个节点中管理多个 LoRA，并分别调整权重，无需串联多个加载节点。\n\n此方式需要额外安装 **rgthree-comfy** 自定义节点包。\n\nUse **Power LoRA Loader** to manage multiple LoRAs and adjust their strengths individually within a single node, without chaining multiple loaders.\n\nThis option requires the **rgthree-comfy** custom node package."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## LoRA Loading — Power LoRA Loader / LoRA 加载\n\n使用 **Power LoRA Loader** 在同一个节点中管理多个 LoRA，并分别调整权重，无需串联多个加载节点。\n\n此方式需要额外安装 **rgthree-comfy** 自定义节点包。\n\nUse **Power LoRA Loader** to manage multiple LoRAs and adjust their strengths individually within a single node, without chaining multiple loaders.\n\nThis option requires the **rgthree-comfy** custom node package."
