      "title": "Workflows Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Penna 标准工作流 / Penna Standard Workflow\n\n适用于 Penna 的 ComfyUI 标准工作流，按模型加载、LoRA 加载、画布设置、提示词输入和图像输出分区排列。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n1. 安装工作流所需的自定义节点，并下载对应模型。\n2. 在 **Load / 模型加载** 区域选择扩散模型、文本编码器和 VAE。\n3. 在 **LoRA Loading / LoRA 加载** 区域添加兼容的 LoRA，并按需调整权重。\n4. 在 **Latent / 画布设置** 区域设置图像宽高。\n5. 在 **Prompt / 提示词** 区域输入提示词，然后运行工作流。\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- LoRA 必须与所选底模兼容。\n- 切换 LoRA 加载方式前，请检查实际生效的节点连线。\n- 如果 Penna 配置引用了节点 ID 或输入名称，请勿随意修改，以免影响参数传递。\n\n## 项目与反馈\n\n[Penna GitHub 仓库](https://github.com/storyAura/penna)\n\n反馈问题时，请附上工作流文件、模型名称和完整报错信息。\n\nA standard ComfyUI workflow for Penna, organized into model loading, LoRA loading, latent settings, prompt input, and image output.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Install the required custom nodes and download the models used by this workflow.\n2. Select the diffusion model, text encoder, and VAE in the **Load** section.\n3. Add or select compatible LoRAs in the **LoRA Loading** section and adjust their strengths as needed.\n4. Set the image dimensions in the **Latent** section.\n5. Enter your prompt in the **Prompt** section, then run the workflow.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Use LoRAs that are compatible with the selected base model.\n- Check the active connections before switching between LoRA loading setups.\n- Keep the node IDs and input names unchanged if they are referenced by your Penna configuration.\n\n## Project & Feedback\n\n[Penna on GitHub](https://github.com/storyAura/penna)\n\nWhen reporting an issue, include your workflow file, model names, and the full error message."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Penna 标准工作流 / Penna Standard Workflow\n\n适用于 Penna 的 ComfyUI 标准工作流，按模型加载、LoRA 加载、画布设置、提示词输入和图像输出分区排列。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n1. 安装工作流所需的自定义节点，并下载对应模型。\n2. 在 **Load / 模型加载** 区域选择扩散模型、文本编码器和 VAE。\n3. 在 **LoRA Loading / LoRA 加载** 区域添加兼容的 LoRA，并按需调整权重。\n4. 在 **Latent / 画布设置** 区域设置图像宽高。\n5. 在 **Prompt / 提示词** 区域输入提示词，然后运行工作流。\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- LoRA 必须与所选底模兼容。\n- 切换 LoRA 加载方式前，请检查实际生效的节点连线。\n- 如果 Penna 配置引用了节点 ID 或输入名称，请勿随意修改，以免影响参数传递。\n\n## 项目与反馈\n\n[Penna GitHub 仓库](https://github.com/storyAura/penna)\n\n反馈问题时，请附上工作流文件、模型名称和完整报错信息。\n\nA standard ComfyUI workflow for Penna, organized into model loading, LoRA loading, latent settings, prompt input, and image output.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Install the required custom nodes and download the models used by this workflow.\n2. Select the diffusion model, text encoder, and VAE in the **Load** section.\n3. Add or select compatible LoRAs in the **LoRA Loading** section and adjust their strengths as needed.\n4. Set the image dimensions in the **Latent** section.\n5. Enter your prompt in the **Prompt** section, then run the workflow.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Use LoRAs that are compatible with the selected base model.\n- Check the active connections before switching between LoRA loading setups.\n- Keep the node IDs and input names unchanged if they are referenced by your Penna configuration.\n\n## Project & Feedback\n\n[Penna on GitHub](https://github.com/storyAura/penna)\n\nWhen reporting an issue, include your workflow file, model names, and the full error message."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
