      "title": "WorkFlows Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model Loading / 模型加载\n\n支持两种模型加载方式，按模型文件的格式选择其中一种即可：\n\n1. **Checkpoint 加载**：使用整合式 Checkpoint 加载模型。\n2. **分离加载**：分别选择并加载 UNet、CLIP 和 VAE。\n\n切换时，请确认后续节点连接到了所选加载方式的输出。\n\nTwo model loading options are available. Choose the one that matches your model files:\n\n1. **Checkpoint loading**: Load the model from a bundled checkpoint.\n2. **Separate loading**: Select and load the UNet, CLIP, and VAE individually.\n\nWhen switching, make sure the downstream nodes are connected to the outputs of your chosen setup."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Model Loading / 模型加载\n\n支持两种模型加载方式，按模型文件的格式选择其中一种即可：\n\n1. **Checkpoint 加载**：使用整合式 Checkpoint 加载模型。\n2. **分离加载**：分别选择并加载 UNet、CLIP 和 VAE。\n\n切换时，请确认后续节点连接到了所选加载方式的输出。\n\nTwo model loading options are available. Choose the one that matches your model files:\n\n1. **Checkpoint loading**: Load the model from a bundled checkpoint.\n2. **Separate loading**: Select and load the UNet, CLIP, and VAE individually.\n\nWhen switching, make sure the downstream nodes are connected to the outputs of your chosen setup."
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
