      "title": "WorkFlows Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Sampling Settings / 采样设置\n\n采样参数需要根据所选底模及其蒸馏版本调整，不能直接套用同一组设置。\n\n- **采样器与调度器**：优先使用模型发布者推荐的组合。\n- **步数与 CFG**：按模型说明设置。加速或蒸馏模型与常规模型的推荐值可能不同；部分 LoRA 也有额外要求。\n- **降噪强度**：文生图通常设为 `1.0`；图生图或重绘时，根据希望保留原图的程度调整。\n- **随机种子**：对比参数效果时固定种子；需要不同结果时再随机化。\n\n当前节点中的 `8 steps / CFG 1.0 / euler / sgm_uniform` 仅是Moos-image工作流的配置，不是所有模型的通用推荐值。切换模型后，请重新检查这些参数。\n\nSampling settings must be adjusted for the selected base model and its distilled variant. One configuration does not fit all models.\n\n- **Sampler and scheduler**: Start with the combination recommended by the model publisher.\n- **Steps and CFG**: Follow the model’s guidance. Accelerated or distilled models may require different values from standard models; some LoRAs also have specific requirements.\n- **Denoise**: Typically set to `1.0` for text-to-image generation. For image-to-image or inpainting, adjust it according to how much of the original image you want to preserve.\n- **Seed**: Keep it fixed when comparing settings. Randomize it when you want different results.\n\nThe current settings of `8 steps / CFG 1.0 / euler / sgm_uniform` belong to this Moos-image workflow and are not universal recommendations. Review them whenever you switch models."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Sampling Settings / 采样设置\n\n采样参数需要根据所选底模及其蒸馏版本调整，不能直接套用同一组设置。\n\n- **采样器与调度器**：优先使用模型发布者推荐的组合。\n- **步数与 CFG**：按模型说明设置。加速或蒸馏模型与常规模型的推荐值可能不同；部分 LoRA 也有额外要求。\n- **降噪强度**：文生图通常设为 `1.0`；图生图或重绘时，根据希望保留原图的程度调整。\n- **随机种子**：对比参数效果时固定种子；需要不同结果时再随机化。\n\n当前节点中的 `8 steps / CFG 1.0 / euler / sgm_uniform` 仅是Moos-image工作流的配置，不是所有模型的通用推荐值。切换模型后，请重新检查这些参数。\n\nSampling settings must be adjusted for the selected base model and its distilled variant. One configuration does not fit all models.\n\n- **Sampler and scheduler**: Start with the combination recommended by the model publisher.\n- **Steps and CFG**: Follow the model’s guidance. Accelerated or distilled models may require different values from standard models; some LoRAs also have specific requirements.\n- **Denoise**: Typically set to `1.0` for text-to-image generation. For image-to-image or inpainting, adjust it according to how much of the original image you want to preserve.\n- **Seed**: Keep it fixed when comparing settings. Randomize it when you want different results.\n\nThe current settings of `8 steps / CFG 1.0 / euler / sgm_uniform` belong to this Moos-image workflow and are not universal recommendations. Review them whenever you switch models."
      },
