      "title": "WorkFlows Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LoRA Loading Options / LoRA 加载方式\n\n两种加载方式二选一，使用时请启用所选区域，并将另一区域设为旁路（Bypass），避免重复叠加 LoRA。\n\n- **LoRA Loading 1**：使用 Power LoRA Loader，在单个节点内管理多个 LoRA，需要安装 rgthree-comfy。\n- **LoRA Loading 2**：使用 ComfyUI 原生加载器，串联多个节点加载 LoRA，无需额外安装自定义节点。\n\nChoose one loading option. Enable the selected section and bypass the other to avoid applying LoRAs twice.\n\n- **LoRA Loading 1**: Use Power LoRA Loader to manage multiple LoRAs within a single node. Requires rgthree-comfy.\n- **LoRA Loading 2**: Use ComfyUI’s built-in loaders, chaining nodes to apply multiple LoRAs. No additional custom nodes are required."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## LoRA Loading Options / LoRA 加载方式\n\n两种加载方式二选一，使用时请启用所选区域，并将另一区域设为旁路（Bypass），避免重复叠加 LoRA。\n\n- **LoRA Loading 1**：使用 Power LoRA Loader，在单个节点内管理多个 LoRA，需要安装 rgthree-comfy。\n- **LoRA Loading 2**：使用 ComfyUI 原生加载器，串联多个节点加载 LoRA，无需额外安装自定义节点。\n\nChoose one loading option. Enable the selected section and bypass the other to avoid applying LoRAs twice.\n\n- **LoRA Loading 1**: Use Power LoRA Loader to manage multiple LoRAs within a single node. Requires rgthree-comfy.\n- **LoRA Loading 2**: Use ComfyUI’s built-in loaders, chaining nodes to apply multiple LoRAs. No additional custom nodes are required."
      },
